WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.367
-Guys, some entertainment news.

00:00:02.367 --> 00:00:03.901
A lot of fans are theorizing that Beyoncé

00:00:03.901 --> 00:00:06.601
has a new album coming soon because of mysterious clues

00:00:06.601 --> 00:00:08.701
that she dropped online this weekend.

00:00:08.701 --> 00:00:10.834
-Yeah, but how do you know for sure?

00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:12.100
Isn't that just a rumor?

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:15.000
-I mean, the clues are everywhere, Tariq.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.901
-Like what? -Okay.

00:00:16.901 --> 00:00:19.133
So, on Friday, Beyoncé deleted her profile pictures

00:00:19.133 --> 00:00:20.634
for all her social-media accounts --

00:00:20.634 --> 00:00:22.100
Twitter, Instagram, TikTok, all of them.

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:25.133
And she still hasn't uploaded new ones over 72 hours later.

00:00:25.133 --> 00:00:26.868
[ Audience oohs ]

00:00:26.868 --> 00:00:28.234
-Go on.

00:00:28.234 --> 00:00:30.801
-Beyoncé's most recent studio album was "Lemonade,"

00:00:30.801 --> 00:00:33.567
which was surprise released over six years ago in 2016.

00:00:33.567 --> 00:00:35.467
But you know what else happened in 2016?

00:00:35.467 --> 00:00:37.601
Her second Super Bowl performance, the one with Coldplay.

00:00:37.601 --> 00:00:39.734
And we all know what happened the day before that performance.

00:00:39.734 --> 00:00:42.234
She surprise released the song for the video "Formation."

00:00:42.234 --> 00:00:43.767
Then immediately after the Super Bowl, the next day,

00:00:43.767 --> 00:00:45.767
she announced The Formation World Tour all before

00:00:45.767 --> 00:00:47.567
anyone even knew that she was going to surprise release

00:00:47.567 --> 00:00:49.133
"Lemonade" that April!

00:00:49.133 --> 00:00:51.868
-Well, that was 2016, though.

00:00:51.868 --> 00:00:53.667
-Right, right, right, but both "Lemonade"

00:00:53.667 --> 00:00:55.868
and her self-titled surprise album, "Beyoncé,"

00:00:55.868 --> 00:00:57.701
had sneaky clues before the release, too,

00:00:57.701 --> 00:01:00.334
like Beyoncé posting pictures of herself with lemons.

00:01:00.334 --> 00:01:02.367
And on Saturday, fans realized

00:01:02.367 --> 00:01:04.534
that if you search Saturday's date, June 11th,

00:01:04.534 --> 00:01:06.734
on Beyoncé website, placeholder art

00:01:06.734 --> 00:01:08.200
for a mysterious Beyoncé album

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:10.133
that's just called "B7" came up.

00:01:10.133 --> 00:01:13.234
"B7." Beyoncé's seventh album. Get it?

00:01:13.234 --> 00:01:15.834
[ Audience oohs ]

00:01:15.834 --> 00:01:17.968
-But she didn't release an album this weekend.

00:01:17.968 --> 00:01:19.834
-Are you even listening? 'Cause then Tidal,

00:01:19.834 --> 00:01:22.667
the streaming service that Jay-Z is on the board of,

00:01:22.667 --> 00:01:24.701
tweeted, "What is a B7?"

00:01:24.701 --> 00:01:28.300
Then just "B8." Jay-Z is Beyoncé's husband.

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:33.534
So, if and when Beyoncé puts out a new album,

00:01:33.534 --> 00:01:35.634
it could be "B7" and "B8."

00:01:35.634 --> 00:01:38.234
That's a double album. Isn't that crazy?!

00:01:38.234 --> 00:01:41.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.634
-Oh, it's crazy alright.

00:01:43.634 --> 00:01:45.601
Crazy in love!

00:01:45.601 --> 00:01:47.634
[ Roots play "Crazy in Love" ]

00:01:47.634 --> 00:01:49.767
♪♪

00:01:49.767 --> 00:01:50.968
Alright.

